WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.146 --> 00:00:14.951
Zann couldn't see what was scaring his parents.

2
00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:20.193
All he could see was their terrified faces and the powerful magic swirling around them.

3
00:00:21.194 --> 00:00:26.457
"No!" Zann cried as his mother screamed and his father let out a yell of fear.

4
00:00:27.357 --> 00:00:32.120
Then he felt a sharp pain on one side of his head, and the vision faded away.

5
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.101
He was still in the vortex.

6
00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:39.224
Wyssa had let go of his arm, but now she was pinching his ear—hard.

7
00:00:39.244 --> 00:00:42.225
"Ow!" Zann exclaimed.

8
00:00:42.765 --> 00:00:43.506
"Stop that!"

9
00:00:43.526 --> 00:00:49.189
"I'll let go of your ear when you let go of that wormhole," Wyssa said.

10
00:00:50.029 --> 00:00:52.751
Zann realized he was clinging to the edge of a wormhole.

11
00:00:53.571 --> 00:00:55.973
He had grabbed it without even knowing he was doing so.

12
00:00:56.733 --> 00:00:57.974
Was that because of the dream?

13
00:00:58.274 --> 00:00:59.795
Could this wormhole be a clue?

14
00:00:59.815 --> 00:01:03.149
"Wait," he said, peering into the wormhole.

15
00:01:04.449 --> 00:01:08.432
He caught a glimpse of purple-leaved trees waving in a soft breeze.

16
00:01:08.452 --> 00:01:14.835
"I want to see if—" Wyssa gave one last yank on Zann's ear, and he lost his grip.

17
00:01:15.636 --> 00:01:18.457
A second later the wormhole was out of sight behind him.

18
00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:20.679
"What was that all about?"

19
00:01:20.879 --> 00:01:21.479
Perda asked.

20
00:01:22.299 --> 00:01:23.400
Zann couldn't respond.

21
00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:26.842
He was too breathless and confused by what had just happened.

22
00:01:26.862 --> 00:01:30.024
"Hold on tight," Wyssa said.

23
00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:33.021
"A useful world is coming up shortly.

24
00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:38.263
You two can rest there and regain your energy while I put my potion together."

25
00:01:39.264 --> 00:01:40.864
She pulled them through a new wormhole.

26
00:01:41.684 --> 00:01:44.846
They landed in a beautiful little park in the middle of a town.

27
00:01:45.666 --> 00:01:51.168
However, Zann barely had a second to take in the scenery before he gasped and grabbed his nose.

28
00:01:51.188 --> 00:01:54.690
"Ew!" Perda cried beside him.

29
00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:56.931
She was pinching her nose shut.

30
00:01:56.951 --> 00:01:59.592
"What is that stink?"

31
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.620
"Where are we?"

32
00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.601
Zann's voice sounded funny now that he was holding his nose.

33
00:02:04.621 --> 00:02:08.062
"Why does it smell so bad?"

34
00:02:08.963 --> 00:02:10.163
Wyssa sniffed the air.

35
00:02:10.183 --> 00:02:11.704
"We're in Niffia.

36
00:02:12.544 --> 00:02:14.464
It may not smell nice to us.

37
00:02:14.825 --> 00:02:19.186
But it's a peaceful place with friendly, intelligent, and welcoming people.

38
00:02:19.986 --> 00:02:21.627
You'll be safe here while I work.

39
00:02:22.447 --> 00:02:25.708
Oh, and your magic should function normally in this world.

40
00:02:26.572 --> 00:02:32.034
So you two might want to create some food to fortify yourselves for the rest of our journey."

41
00:02:32.895 --> 00:02:35.416
Zann couldn't imagine wanting to eat anything in this place.

42
00:02:36.136 --> 00:02:39.998
Before he or Perda could say anything else, though, Wyssa zapped out of sight.

43
00:02:40.018 --> 00:02:42.339
"Ugh," Perda said.

44
00:02:42.359 --> 00:02:44.760
"I can't believe this stench!"

45
00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:48.722
"Yeah. I can't stand it any longer."

46
00:02:49.682 --> 00:02:52.383
Zann let go of his nose and rubbed his hands together.

47
00:02:52.403 --> 00:02:54.164
"Protect!" he said.

48
00:02:54.988 --> 00:02:57.910
He frowned as a puff of smoke wafted up from his hands.

49
00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.251
Nothing else happened.

50
00:02:59.972 --> 00:03:01.292
"What are you trying to do?"

51
00:03:01.653 --> 00:03:02.253
Perda asked.

52
00:03:02.273 --> 00:03:05.355
"Create a Shield spell around my head."

53
00:03:06.236 --> 00:03:07.557
Zann grabbed his nose again.

54
00:03:07.577 --> 00:03:11.820
"I thought Wyssa said our magic would work here."

55
00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.281
Perda shrugged.

56
00:03:13.301 --> 00:03:15.743
"Magic requires focusing our minds.

57
00:03:16.183 --> 00:03:19.485
It's pretty hard to focus on anything except this awful smell."

58
00:03:20.446 --> 00:03:23.368
Zann saw several figures hurrying toward them across the park.

59
00:03:24.044 --> 00:03:29.308
They looked like regular humans except for one thing: they had no noses!

60
00:03:29.328 --> 00:03:31.949
"Welcome!" a man said.

61
00:03:31.969 --> 00:03:34.031
"Are you visitors to Niffia?"

62
00:03:34.051 --> 00:03:36.633
"Yes," Zann said.

63
00:03:36.653 --> 00:03:38.874
"We, um, won't be here long.

64
00:03:39.214 --> 00:03:40.415
Sorry to bother you."

65
00:03:40.435 --> 00:03:42.356
"No bother at all!"

66
00:03:42.637 --> 00:03:43.517
The Niffian beamed.

67
00:03:43.537 --> 00:03:47.220
"We love visitors, and yet we have so few.

68
00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.921
May we show you around town?"

69
00:03:49.681 --> 00:03:53.164
For the next half hour, the Niffians gave Zann and Perda a tour.

70
00:03:54.188 --> 00:03:56.710
The rest of the town was just as charming as the park.

71
00:03:57.891 --> 00:04:01.695
Everywhere Zann and Perda went, friendly Niffians stopped to say hello.

72
00:04:02.595 --> 00:04:04.477
Even the songs of the birds were beautiful.

73
00:04:04.497 --> 00:04:10.222
"Too bad we don't know any spells to shut off our sense of smell," Perda whispered to Zann.

74
00:04:10.242 --> 00:04:12.584
"Yeah," Zann muttered back.

75
00:04:13.364 --> 00:04:15.086
He wasn't paying much attention to the tour.

76
00:04:16.227 --> 00:04:19.530
He wished Wyssa would hurry, and not only because of the smell.

77
00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.992
He was worried about Gliss, Darb, and Zing.

78
00:04:22.868 --> 00:04:24.669
Finally Wyssa zapped into sight.

79
00:04:24.689 --> 00:04:28.830
"Wyssa?" One of the Niffians greeted her with a smile.

80
00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:33.371
"It's been far too long since we've enjoyed a visit from you!"

81
00:04:34.652 --> 00:04:35.412
Wyssa bowed.

82
00:04:35.432 --> 00:04:38.733
"Thank you for your hospitality, my friend.

83
00:04:39.433 --> 00:04:43.374
I'm grateful that you're always so generous with your natural resources.

84
00:04:44.315 --> 00:04:48.676
Once again I've found exactly what I need for one of my potions."

85
00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.941
Wyssa held up her hands, which were now covered with strange purple symbols.

86
00:04:53.961 --> 00:04:57.542
"Ah," another Niffian said with a smile.

87
00:04:57.562 --> 00:05:02.604
"Yes, our native oogberry is useful for many spells, isn't it?"

88
00:05:02.624 --> 00:05:05.244
"Indeed," Wyssa said.

89
00:05:05.264 --> 00:05:08.505
"Now I'm afraid my young friends and I must be going.

90
00:05:09.205 --> 00:05:11.466
We have urgent business in the vortex."

91
00:05:11.486 --> 00:05:14.347
"Travel safely," a Niffian said.

92
00:05:14.367 --> 00:05:17.448
"I hope we'll see you all again soon."

93
00:05:17.468 --> 00:05:19.809
"Thanks," Zann said.

94
00:05:20.269 --> 00:05:21.770
He had enjoyed meeting the Niffians.

95
00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:27.233
But secretly he hoped he'd never have to smell anything like Niffia ever again!

96
00:05:28.754 --> 00:05:32.336
Soon Wyssa, Zann, and Perda were passing through the wormhole.

97
00:05:32.356 --> 00:05:35.018
"Whew!" Perda exclaimed.

98
00:05:35.038 --> 00:05:38.720
"I've never been so glad to be back in the vortex!"

99
00:05:39.801 --> 00:05:40.902
"What happens now?"

100
00:05:41.282 --> 00:05:42.202
Zann asked Wyssa.

101
00:05:42.983 --> 00:05:44.364
Wyssa stared at her hands.

102
00:05:45.272 --> 00:05:49.576
"These markings will let us know which wormholes have been used recently."

103
00:05:50.737 --> 00:05:52.538
The group drifted through the vortex.

104
00:05:53.279 --> 00:05:56.501
After a few minutes, the purple symbols began to glow.

105
00:05:56.521 --> 00:05:59.724
"There's a wormhole just ahead," said Wyssa.

106
00:05:59.744 --> 00:06:02.486
"Someone has passed through it recently."

107
00:06:03.307 --> 00:06:05.849
She reached out as an opening spun into view.

108
00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.572
A moment later Zann felt himself leave the vortex.

109
00:06:10.533 --> 00:06:14.136
"Oof!" he grunted as he landed on cold, hard ground.

110
00:06:15.168 --> 00:06:19.793
This new world was so dark, Zann could barely see his hand in front of his face.

111
00:06:20.693 --> 00:06:22.935
A strange buzzing sound filled the air.

112
00:06:23.756 --> 00:06:25.798
It seemed to be coming from all around them.

113
00:06:26.579 --> 00:06:28.801
Feeling nervous, Zann snapped his fingers.

114
00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:32.064
"Light," he whispered, holding out his hand.

115
00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:35.567
A glowing orb of light appeared in his hand.

116
00:06:36.388 --> 00:06:39.571
A second later it exploded into a huge fireball!
